// bitshuffle-LZ4 block decode: the decode loop shared by the unfused
// Lz4DecodeBlocks entry and (Phase 3 step 2) the fused Lz4DecodeUnshuffle entry.
// A Slang port of the LZ4 decoder in bslz4_to_sparse (src/cuda/nvcomp_lz4.cuh),
// itself an edited copy of NVIDIA's nvCOMP LZ4 decompression kernel.
